# 12. Public Storefront

Every approved seller receives a storefront.

Example:

# CRK Jewelers

The storefront may contain:

* Store logo.
* Store banner.
* Selling Name.
* Store description.
* Product catalogue.
* Ratings.
* Reviews.
* Store policies.
* Verified status where applicable.

The storefront must not expose the private identity of a child creator.

