# 14. Restricted Products

Tiny Tycoons should initially restrict higher-risk products.

Potential restricted or prohibited categories include:

* Food.
* Beverages.
* Cosmetics.
* Electrical devices.
* Batteries.
* Chemicals.
* Medicines.
* Medical devices.
* Age-restricted products.
* Weapons.
* Weapon-like products.
* Unsafe toys.
* Counterfeit products.
* Products infringing intellectual property.

Certain categories may later be introduced following appropriate compliance and safety processes.

