The final stack should be selected based on development-team expertise, but a suitable architecture is:

### Frontend

Next.js / React

TypeScript

Responsive Web Design

### Backend

Node.js

NestJS or Express

TypeScript

REST API or GraphQL

### Database

PostgreSQL

### ORM

Prisma or TypeORM

### Cache

Redis

### Payments

Stripe

Stripe Connect

### File Storage

AWS S3 or equivalent object storage

### CDN

CloudFront or equivalent

### Email

Transactional email provider

### Infrastructure

AWS, Azure, or Google Cloud

### Monitoring

Centralized logging

Application monitoring

Error tracking

