# 49. Core User Journey – Customer

Customer Visits Tiny Tycoons

↓

Browses Marketplace

↓

Discovers Product

↓

Views Product

↓

Views Public Store

↓

Adds Product to Cart

↓

Completes Checkout

↓

Pays Securely

↓

Receives Order Confirmation

↓

Tracks Order

↓

Receives Product

↓

Leaves Review

